# Mario Kart: Super Circuit (USA): the title to a race, the kart accelerating for a long time (gate G9, route depth; the long route of the panel).
# Start and A taps every 30 frames from frame 300 to 1,700 (the title, the choices left to the default, the start of the race), then A held from 1,800 to 9,000 with no steering: the kart accelerates, leaves the track and drives on the grass while the timer runs (a long run, not a lap).
# The race starts about frame 1,500; the frame limit is 9,000. For the delivered player with no save.
